    "description": "\u2b50The thrill of the best Vegas slots is right at your fingertips with Pulsz.\r\nJoin the excitement with a special welcome gift! \u2b50\r\n\r\nGet set for awesome free Vegas-style slots and cool casino games. Download the Pulsz app to enjoy easy-to-play slot games and score big wins.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf52 New to Pulsz? Get 5,000 Free Gold Coins when you sign up. What else?\r\n\r\n\u2022 Over 500 games and more added every week\r\n\u2022 Daily free coins are always up for grabs\r\n\u2022 No purchase is necessary\r\n\u2022 Get customer support 24/7\r\n\u2022 Join more exciting promotions\r\n\u2022 Enjoy uninterrupted action with zero ads\r\n\u2022 Play safely at home\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb0 Join Us on a Fun Slots Journey\r\n\r\nOur super slot games are free to play and they come with exciting features:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Join the biggest daily slots tournaments and jackpot races\r\n\u2022 Enjoy exciting slot features and huge prizes\r\n\u2022 Discover the best slots app with easy navigation\r\n\u2022 Play tons of premium online slot games\r\n\r\nOur free slots app keeps things fresh by constantly bringing in exciting new games, so you'll never have a dull moment. Stay up-to-date with the latest and most entertaining slots from top-notch providers around the globe.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 We've also got special Jackpots, Hold and Win, Avalanche and Megaways slots for you! These come packed with amazing features and offer even bigger prizes than your average games.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Explore a collection of casino slot games like Starburst, Big Bass Bonanza, Epic Joker, Hot Triple Sevens, Money Cart 2, Mystic Fortune Deluxe, Hot Hot Fruit and Hit the Gold.\r\n\r\nPlay Free Vegas Slots and Casino Games\r\n\u2022 Great collection of free Vegas casino slots and the best casino games\r\n\u2022 Las Vegas 777 style slot machines for maximum fun\r\n\u2022 Sophisticated table games, such as Blackjack and Texas Hold'em\r\n\r\nWill you win the jackpot? Try your luck now with our free welcome gift for new players. You\u2019ll love it! Join thousands of slots and casino players and experience the best, free Vegas games in town. Enjoy the best free casino game thrills at Pulsz now!\r\n\r\nLEGAL\r\nGoogle is in no way involved with Pulsz; it does not sponsor or endorse this App.\r\n\r\nThere Is No Real Money Gaming Offered in This App and Is Intended Solely for Entertainment Purposes. No purchase is necessary.\r\n\r\nThe App is available in 47 US States and the District of Columbia: Alabama, Alaska, Arizona, Arkansas, California, Colorado, Connecticut, Delaware, Florida, Georgia, Hawaii, Illinois, Indiana, Iowa, Kansas, Kentucky, Louisiana, Maine, Maryland, Massachusetts, Michigan, Minnesota, Mississippi, Missouri, Montana, Nebraska, New Hampshire, New Jersey, New Mexico, New York, North Carolina, North Dakota, Ohio, Oklahoma, Oregon, Pennsylvania, Rhode Island, South Carolina, South Dakota, Tennessee, Texas, Utah, Vermont, Virginia, West Virginia, Wisconsin and Wyoming.\r\n\r\nPulsz does not endorse or promote real money gambling. Users must be 18 or over.\r\n\r\nFor full terms and conditions, visit: www.pulsz.com/terms\r\nNeed support? Reach out to us on support at pulsz (dot) com",
